    <string name="home_wireless_adb_starting_without_wifi">Starting with no network: the device is asked for wireless debugging over and over until it stays on. This can take up to two minutes before it starts or gives up.</string>
    <string name="home_usb_adb_needs_network">A USB start uses the classic ADB port, and reopening it needs a network. Connect to Wi-Fi once, or use the wireless start above.</string>
    <string name="home_usb_adb_falls_back_to_wireless">USB start uses the ADB port, which needs a network connection to open again. Since Start without Wi-Fi is on, Shizuku will use wireless debugging instead.</string>
